event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 1\n\nMan, I’m so sorry. If you’ve been dealing with"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" that kind of misery for months, I completely understand why you've reached a breaking point. \n\nBefore you hand"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" in your notice tomorrow, though, do you want to vent or talk through the logistics first? Quitting might 100% be the"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" right move, but I don't want you to trade one kind of stress for another if you don't have a"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" safety net or next step lined up. \n\nCall me tonight if you're free, or let me buy you dinner. Even"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" if you still walk in tomorrow and quit, let’s make sure you do it on your terms with a clear head.\n\n## 2"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\n\nI understand being skeptical of official images, especially now when digital editing and CGI are so ubiquitous. But the evidence that the Earth is a"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" sphere doesn't rely on space agencies or modern photography—people figured it out thousands of years ago using simple observation.\n\nFor"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" example, during a lunar eclipse, the Earth casts a shadow on the Moon, and that shadow is always a smooth, circular"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" arc no matter what angle the eclipse happens at; only a sphere casts a round shadow from every direction. You can also watch a"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" ship sail away toward the horizon: the hull disappears first, followed gradually by the mast, from the bottom up. If"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" the Earth were flat, a telescope would bring the whole ship back into view, but it doesn't. \n\nBeyond"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" that, things like the differing constellations visible in the Northern versus Southern hemispheres, or how pilots calculate flight paths across the southern oceans"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", only work mathematically on a globe. You don't have to take anyone's word or trust a photo to test"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" those things yourself.\n\n## 3\n\nSunlight looks white, but it’s actually a mix of all the colors"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" of the rainbow combined together. \n\nLight travels in waves, and each color has a different wavelength. Red and orange light travel"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" in long, lazy waves, while blue and violet light travel in short, choppy, frantic waves. \n\nWhen sunlight reaches Earth, it"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" runs into our atmosphere, which is packed full of invisible gas molecules like nitrogen and oxygen. The long, red waves pass right through those"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" molecules without bumping into much. But the short, choppy blue waves hit the gas molecules and scatter in every direction—like a"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" pinball bouncing around bumpers. \n\nWhen you look up during the day, you’re looking at all that scattered blue light bouncing across"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" the entire sky and down into your eyes. (You might wonder why it isn't violet, since violet has even"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" shorter waves: sunlight naturally contains far more blue light than violet, and human eyes are much better at detecting blue!)\n\n## 4\n\n夜"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"幕低垂，窗外的雨淅淅沥沥地下着，将白日里城市的喧嚣冲刷得干"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"干净净。街灯在湿漉漉的沥青路面上晕开一圈圈昏黄的光晕，"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"偶有车辆驶过，轮胎带起一层薄薄的水雾，转瞬又归于平静。密集的雨"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"滴敲打着玻璃窗，发出清脆而有节奏的声响，宛如一首天然的催"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"眠曲。屋内亮着一盏暖灯，捧一杯热茶，在这潮湿而微凉的夜色"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"中，竟生出一种难得的安宁与惬意。\n\n## 5\n\nHi [Name],\n\nThanks so"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" much for organizing this and sending the invite! \n\nUnfortunately, I won't be able to make it this Friday"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" as I already have plans. I hope you all have a great time, and I'll definitely catch you at the next one"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":".\n\nHave a great weekend,\n\n[My Name]\n\n## 6\n\nMy writing style is clear, adaptable, and direct"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", focused on delivering substance with a natural and context-appropriate tone."}}

